{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-tracker-services-2-a-01","date":"2026-11-24","lens":"6","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-2","refs":["F-phone-635"],"severity":"S3","title":"When a saved workout will not delete, the app says try again but keeps no note of why","what":"Deleting a saved workout that fails shows 'Could not delete this workout. It is still here. Please try again.' The error itself is thrown away, so nobody, not the member and not MettleUp, can later tell what went wrong.","expected":"Every failed delete keeps a short note of the reason, so a repeat failure can be looked into.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/workoutDelete.ts:56-62","apps/mobile/src/tracker/lib/useWorkoutActions.ts:157-160"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"delete-failure-reason-thrown-away","who":"members","how_often":"rare","fix_line":"Keep a note of the error before showing the try-again line","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-tracker-services-2-a-02","date":"2026-11-24","lens":"6","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-2","refs":["F-phone-614","F-phone-615"],"severity":"S3","title":"If the 'Rest is over' alert cannot be set, the member is not told and no note is kept","what":"Starting a rest first asks the phone's own rest card to show it; if that fails, the app falls back to a scheduled alert. Both steps swallow any error silently. If both fail, the rest runs on screen but no 'Rest is over' buzz comes on the lock screen or watch, the member gets no warning, and nothing records why.","expected":"A rest alert that could not be set leaves a note of the reason, and the member sees that this rest will not buzz.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/restCard.ts:142-174","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/workoutAlerts.ts:174-212"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"rest-alert-failure-not-logged","who":"members","how_often":"rare","fix_line":"Log both failures and show a small line when neither alert could be set","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
